# Third-Party Notices

`gamenative-drm` ships no third-party binary artifact. Vendored source under
`lsfg/` is compiled into `libadrenotools_gamescope.so`, which is packaged into
GameNative.

---

## LSFG frame-generation engine (`lsfg/engine/`)

Adopted from GameNative's `app/src/main/cpp/lsfg/`, which is
**GPL-3.0-or-later**. The authors, provenance (lsfg-vk, the Eden Emulator LSFG
port, WinNative's Winlator adaptation) and license text are recorded in
GameNative's `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES`, which ships with the application this library
is packaged into.

`libadrenotools_gamescope.so`, once this engine is linked into it, is
distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later — the same license as that application.

The compute passes are built from shaders extracted at runtime from the user's
own `Lossless.dll` (Lossless Scaling on Steam). Neither the DLL nor its shaders
are distributed.

